es only 4-5 hours to fully replenish the battery. When you’re done cleaning, this machine's 4.5 hours charge time ensures it will be ready when you are.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gtwxa435jhotvc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Long-Lasting Battery: The removable, upgraded 8-cell lithium-ion battery ensures extended runtime for more thorough cleaning sessions, provides up to 60 minutes of continuous cleaning power, covering up to 250 square meters on a single charge.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;h4\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gtxmtqdm328sh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;before\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;after\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;line\u0026quot;:0.8529411764705882}},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;bold\u0026quot;:true,\u0026quot;sz\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;szUnit\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;pt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Control Dust Allergen Smartly \u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gtxblcx35j7msv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Multi-stage Filtration: fully-sealed filtration system seals in microscopic dust, expelling cleaner air, for a healthier home.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbsu5gtxnk9qt5ke5jk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026q